ChildVault_executeEpochWithdraw
├── when caller does not have EPOCH_OPERATOR_ROLE
│   └── it should revert
├── when there is no active adapter
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoActiveAdapter
├── when withdraw succeeds
│   ├── it should withdraw from the active adapter
│   ├── it should bridge withdrawn USDC to Parent
│   └── when ccipSend reverts
│       └── it should store CCIP send recovery
├── when withdraw adapter reverts
│   ├── it should emit failure without bridging
│   ├── it should store epoch withdraw recovery
│   ├── it should emit EpochWithdrawRecoveryStored
│   └── when epoch withdraw recovery already exists
│       └── it should revert with BaseVault__RecoveryAlreadyPending
└── when withdraw adapter returns zero
    └── it should store epoch withdraw recovery
